DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261118T000000Z
DTEND:20261118T021500Z
SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero (2026)
LOCATION:OMSI Empirical Theatre\, 1945 SE Water Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5083;-122.6672
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Takashi Yamazaki · 135 min\n\nWar reduced Japan to zero\,
  and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\, an
 d the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finall
 y reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won 
 peace\, a new threat strikes\, crushing hope in an instant. There is no th
 ird time. Everything ends here.\n\nTickets: https://tickets.omsi.edu/event
 s/01a08223-de84-135c-b4ca-3c09637e7566\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohk
 amp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://tickets.omsi.edu/events/01a08223-de84-135c-b4ca-3c09637e7566
END:VEVENT
